\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1.&nbsp;Front-end development skills<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HTML<\/a>&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CSS<\/a>&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/javascript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript<\/a>&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>TypeScript&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>React.js \/ Next.js&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tailwind CSS&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Back-end development skills<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python<\/a>&nbsp;\/&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Java<\/a>&nbsp;\/ Node.js&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Express.js \/&nbsp;FastAPI&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DBMS (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>REST APIs &amp;&nbsp;GraphQL&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Version Control (Git, GitHub)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Docker &amp; Basic DevOps&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.&nbsp;Emerging Skills (High Demand in 2026)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>AI\/LLM Integration (OpenAI, Gemini, Anthropic APIs)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cloud Fundamentals (AWS, GCP, or Azure)&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>It is to be noted that a full-stack developer might not have skills in all programming languages and frameworks. One can learn these concepts by going for an offline or&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/web-development-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">online web development course in India<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Average Full Stack Developer Salary in India (2026 Data)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>What is the average salary of a full-stack web developer in India? This is among the most asked questions by people who are looking to build a career in this field. We&nbsp;have got&nbsp;it covered below in detail.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Average Annual Salary<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The average annual salary for a&nbsp;full stack developer&nbsp;in India is approximately <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b99.2&nbsp;lakhs to \u20b910.2&nbsp;lakhs<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Average Monthly Salary<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The average&nbsp;full stack developer salary per month in&nbsp;India is around \u20b977,000 to \u20b985,000, which translates to an annual package of approximately \u20b99.2 lakh to \u20b910.2 lakh.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Full Stack Developer Salary&nbsp;for&nbsp;Freshers or Entry Level<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Beginners in the industry often wonder what&nbsp;is the full stack developer salary in India for freshers.&nbsp;Let\u2019s&nbsp;know this as well here.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The fresher full-stack developers earn between&nbsp;\u20b94.1&nbsp;and&nbsp;\u20b94.6&nbsp;LPA, depending on the company, location of the job, and level of candidate skills.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. For 2 Years of Experience<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The average salary of a full-stack developer with 2-3 years of experience is around&nbsp;\u20b95.7&nbsp;LPA.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. After 5 Years<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The full-stack web developers with 5+ years of experience earn above \u20b99.9&nbsp;LPA in India.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:3