 Ahmedabad, Lucknow, Chandigarh, Bhopal, etc.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here in this write-up, we have also mentioned different cities to give you a better idea of the full stack developer salary in Chennai, Pune,&nbsp;Bangalore, Mumbai, Hyderabad, Kolkata,&nbsp;Kerala, Delhi, etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>City Name&nbsp;<\/td><td>Average Salary Paid&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Bangalore&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/bengaluru-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b910.9&nbsp;LPA<\/a>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Chennai&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/chennai-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b99.7 LPA<\/a>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mumbai&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/mumbai-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b99.6&nbsp;LPA<\/a>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pune&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/pune-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b910.6&nbsp;LPA<\/a>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Hyderabad&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/hyderabad-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b910.8&nbsp;LPA<\/a>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>New Delhi&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/new-delhi-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b98.7&nbsp;LPA<\/a>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Noida&nbsp;<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/full-stack-developer-salary\/noida-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b98.1&nbsp;L